.TH PING "8" "July 2026" "PiggyOS" "System Administration"

.SH NAME
ping \- display system information with a pig-themed twist

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ping

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
Display certain system information with a pig-themed twist.

.SH OPTIONS

.TP
.B \-a
Audible ping

.TP
.B \-c COUNT
Stop after sending COUNT packets

.TP
.B \-I INTERFACE
Bind to either the interface or address specified by INTERFACE

